  "S01276/S01319: arid-zone canyon rendered 'Arid Canyon' (could be 'Desert Canyon').",
  "S01284/S01327: 'Wreckage' (could be 'Debris Field').",
  "S01296/S01339: 'Colony Cluster'.",
  "S01302-S01315: VS list labels (likely internal/debug); series kept terse: Original, 08, 80, 83, Z, ZZ, CCA, 91.",
  "S00965-S01013: scene-list labels look like a debug menu; translated anyway ('Stage Clear Art', 'Card Acquired').",
